  If you use this software, please cite the original enviPat algorithm paper
  (preferred citation) and, where relevant, this Python port.
title: pyEnvipat
type: software
version: 1.0.4
license: GPL-2.0-only
abstract: >-
  Python port of the R package enviPat: isotope fine structure patterns,
  theoretical mass spectrometry envelopes, centroid detection and instrument
  resolution interpolation.
repository-code: https://github.com/eawag-uchem-msf/pyenvipat
